{"2890060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Midnight Mayhem", "steam_appid": 2890060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bring your own friends</h2>You probably won't find anyone online, so make sure to bring a friend!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/268512bd5b3811d37151a51c9eab54d3.webp?t=1769693681\" alt=\"Supernatural mayhem\" width=780 height=38 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/a48128f1b0796018852fb849ab4e62a4.poster.avif?t=1769693681\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/a48128f1b0796018852fb849ab4e62a4.webm?t=1769693681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/a48128f1b0796018852fb849ab4e62a4.mp4?t=1769693681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Be prepared for anything as the monsters abilities keep evolving and changing!</strong><br>The monster player has limited control over their next ability so they will also have to think quickly to make the best use of them!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/ae30203173c4413e7f481d3953a45066.webp?t=1769693681\" alt=\"It&#039;s in the shadows\" width=780 height=38 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/fc844d773555b5f1c9544b786794f58e.poster.avif?t=1769693681\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/fc844d773555b5f1c9544b786794f58e.webm?t=1769693681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/fc844d773555b5f1c9544b786794f58e.mp4?t=1769693681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Hide in the shadows and kill your prey one by one!</strong><br>Stalk your prey from a distance and stay as close as possible without being seen. Then strike before they have time to react!<br><br>You're completely invisible in the shadows. Avoid light at all cost!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/b1fe8056167acd5095f020fef55a0043.webp?t=1769693681\" alt=\"Defend yourself\" width=780 height=38 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/c85909a96039d80478fb324e76747819.poster.avif?t=1769693681\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/c85909a96039d80478fb324e76747819.webm?t=1769693681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/c85909a96039d80478fb324e76747819.mp4?t=1769693681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Use various improvised weapons and gadgets to locate and defend from the monster. </strong><br>Use the right tool at the right time to shift the tides!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/8147c5848e7e4d14c6587a00979d32e6.webp?t=1769693681\" alt=\"Survive and banish it\" width=780 height=38 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/9a0fc5ea0bf84a09f9abb9ff61002e23.poster.avif?t=1769693681\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/9a0fc5ea0bf84a09f9abb9ff61002e23.webm?t=1769693681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/9a0fc5ea0bf84a09f9abb9ff61002e23.mp4?t=1769693681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Work together to survive and banish the monster once and for all!</strong><br>Don't forget to check the shadows and keep a light source close by, once it decides to attack it's already too late!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/145d0c0ffbac78b67a395cbf76c9987c.webp?t=1769693681\" alt=\"1 monster vs up to 5 humans\" width=780 height=38 /></span><br>Work with your friends or try to brutally murder them!<br><br>The game supports proximity chat with other effects like echo in certain locations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/c758ee5727ea488c2faf270faff72919.webp?t=1769693681\" alt=\"Learning curve warning\" width=780 height=38 /></span><br>Midnight Mayhem has some unique mechanics that take time to master. If you're looking for a simple game you can pick up in a couple minutes, this may not be the game for you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/9c8c7c1148719497ff479f679423ed1c.webp?t=1769693681\" alt=\"Join the discord\" width=780 height=38 /></span><br>Join the Discord using the button on the right side of the page!<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Proximity chat<br></li><li>2-6 players<br></li><li>19 Strange monster abilities<br></li><li>5 Maps<br></li><li>5 Main weapons<br></li><li>6 Different gadgets and tools<br></li><li>6 Modulators to switch up the gameplay<br></li><li>11 Unlockable masks to customize your character<br></li><li>Xbox controller support</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bring your own friends</h2>You probably won't find anyone online, so make sure to bring a friend!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/268512bd5b3811d37151a51c9eab54d3.webp?t=1769693681\" alt=\"Supernatural mayhem\" width=780 height=38 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/a48128f1b0796018852fb849ab4e62a4.poster.avif?t=1769693681\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/a48128f1b0796018852fb849ab4e62a4.webm?t=1769693681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/a48128f1b0796018852fb849ab4e62a4.mp4?t=1769693681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Be prepared for anything as the monsters abilities keep evolving and changing!</strong><br>The monster player has limited control over their next ability so they will also have to think quickly to make the best use of them!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/ae30203173c4413e7f481d3953a45066.webp?t=1769693681\" alt=\"It&#039;s in the shadows\" width=780 height=38 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/fc844d773555b5f1c9544b786794f58e.poster.avif?t=1769693681\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/fc844d773555b5f1c9544b786794f58e.webm?t=1769693681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/fc844d773555b5f1c9544b786794f58e.mp4?t=1769693681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Hide in the shadows and kill your prey one by one!</strong><br>Stalk your prey from a distance and stay as close as possible without being seen. Then strike before they have time to react!<br><br>You're completely invisible in the shadows. Avoid light at all cost!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/b1fe8056167acd5095f020fef55a0043.webp?t=1769693681\" alt=\"Defend yourself\" width=780 height=38 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/c85909a96039d80478fb324e76747819.poster.avif?t=1769693681\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/c85909a96039d80478fb324e76747819.webm?t=1769693681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/c85909a96039d80478fb324e76747819.mp4?t=1769693681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Use various improvised weapons and gadgets to locate and defend from the monster. </strong><br>Use the right tool at the right time to shift the tides!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/8147c5848e7e4d14c6587a00979d32e6.webp?t=1769693681\" alt=\"Survive and banish it\" width=780 height=38 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/9a0fc5ea0bf84a09f9abb9ff61002e23.poster.avif?t=1769693681\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/9a0fc5ea0bf84a09f9abb9ff61002e23.webm?t=1769693681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/9a0fc5ea0bf84a09f9abb9ff61002e23.mp4?t=1769693681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Work together to survive and banish the monster once and for all!</strong><br>Don't forget to check the shadows and keep a light source close by, once it decides to attack it's already too late!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/145d0c0ffbac78b67a395cbf76c9987c.webp?t=1769693681\" alt=\"1 monster vs up to 5 humans\" width=780 height=38 /></span><br>Work with your friends or try to brutally murder them!<br><br>The game supports proximity chat with other effects like echo in certain locations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/c758ee5727ea488c2faf270faff72919.webp?t=1769693681\" alt=\"Learning curve warning\" width=780 height=38 /></span><br>Midnight Mayhem has some unique mechanics that take time to master. If you're looking for a simple game you can pick up in a couple minutes, this may not be the game for you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/9c8c7c1148719497ff479f679423ed1c.webp?t=1769693681\" alt=\"Join the discord\" width=780 height=38 /></span><br>Join the Discord using the button on the right side of the page!<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Proximity chat<br></li><li>2-6 players<br></li><li>19 Strange monster abilities<br></li><li>5 Maps<br></li><li>5 Main weapons<br></li><li>6 Different gadgets and tools<br></li><li>6 Modulators to switch up the gameplay<br></li><li>11 Unlockable masks to customize your character<br></li><li>Xbox controller support</li></ul>", "short_description": "Work together to survive against an invisible monster with ever changing abilities. Asymmetric horror game best played with friends! (NO PUBLIC LOBBIES)", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/header.jpg?t=1769693681", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/7aa4a9a1c29ed00c589ebe45ce0b15d66558c191/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769693681", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/7aa4a9a1c29ed00c589ebe45ce0b15d66558c191/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769693681", "website": "https://gradientgames.net/games/midnight-mayhem", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or above<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Needs to be tested further</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 3 3100 or equal<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon RX 560 / Nvidia Geforce GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": 